  "prefLabel": "Env-A 608.01 Specific Applicability for State Permits to Operate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 608.01 Specific Applicability for State Permits to Operate. The owner or operator of any stationary source, area source, or device that is specified in Env-A 607.01 and is not required to obtain a Title V permit pursuant to Env-A 609.01 shall file a timely and complete application for, and obtain, a state permit to operate as specified in this chapter.\n\nSource. #721.16 eff 12-7-75; amd by #1375, eff 7-1-79; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9791, eff 10-1-10; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
